BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Runners
UID:event_314984063@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260602T043213Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260602T181500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260602T201500
SUMMARY:Tuesday Brewsday New Belgium
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Runners\nWe're back to New Belgium with a modified r
 oute\, but it'll still have the same fun. We'll meet out in the field near
  the road\n\nNew Belgium\n3.1 miles\nR on Craven\ncross bridge\nstraight o
 n new\nHaywood\nR on Roberts\nL on Haywood\nstraight on Clingman\nR on Hil
 liard\nL on French Broad\nL on Haywood\nbecomes Clingman\nStraight on Hayw
 ood\ncross bridge\nR on Craven\nback to brewery\n\nNew Belgium\n5.0 miles\
 nR on Craven\ncross bridge\nstraight on N Haywood\nR on Roberts\nL on Hayw
 ood\nStraight on Clingman\nR on Hilliard\nL on French Broad\nL on Haywood\
 nR on Montford\nR on Bearden\nL on Cumberland\nL on Montford Pk Pl\nL on M
 ontford\nR on Haywood\nbecomes Clingman\nStraight on Haywood\ncross bridge
 \nR on Craven\nback to brewery
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-runners/events/314984063/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260527T205925Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260527T205925Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Runners
UID:event_312835134@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260602T043213Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260604T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260604T200000
SUMMARY:Thursday Run 
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Runners\nCome run 1\, 3\, or 6 miles and stay for a 
 beer and soccer tennis after at Olde London Road.\n\nRoutes-\n1 miler:\nRI
 GHT out of OLR parking lot\nContinue around roundabout at Clingman\, and h
 ead toward the river on Lyman St.\nRIGHT on River Arts Place\nCross Rivers
 ide onto the Greenway\nRight on the Greenway to the Craven St Park put in 
 (the dock)\nTurn around and go back the same way to OLR\n\n3 miler:\nStart
  the same as 1 miler\nContinue onto Craven St. Bridge\nLEFT onto Greenway 
 after bridge\nFollow Greenway all the way until it ends at Haywood Rd.\nRI
 GHT onto Haywood Rd\, go across the bridge\nCross the Roundabout at Robert
 s St. and continue onto Clingman\nContinue on Clingman\nLEFT onto Owens Be
 ll Lane\nLEFT onto Hilliard at the top of the hill\nLEFT onto W Haywood\, 
 follow all the way down to Roberts\nLEFT onto Roberts\nFollow Roberts back
  to OLR\nPass OLR to Bartlett\, turn around and come back to OLR\n\n6 mile
 r:\nAfter the W Haywood downhill to Roberts\nLEFT onto Roberts St. take to
  Lyman and head back to the Greenway\nLEFT onto the Greenway\, take all th
 e way to Amboy\nRIGHT on Amboy to cross the bridge\nRIGHT into French Broa
 d River Park\, run the loop at the park\nCross back over the bridge on Amb
 oy and run the Greenway back to the roundabout\nFollow Lyman back to OLR
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-runners/events/312835134/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260111T194433Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260111T194433Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
